DATA SOURCES (web hooks ported — names kept at the Swift call sites)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
useVehicles        → ExploreDataSource.useVehicles()  (GET /vehicles) — vehicle count gates the catalog.
useIsForwardAuth   → ExploreDataSource.useIsForwardAuth()             — gates the admin/system group.
(recentRoutePaths()  ← web lib/recentPages registry — not an API hook — feeds the recent strip.)
Bound through the @Observable ExplorePageModel; the view holds zero networking (ADR-004).
No live SSE source on this page (vehicles/auth are not streams) → no staleness indicator needed.
No SI units are stored/computed on this page (no numeric telemetry) → unit boundary N/A.

